OL,3,ACatherine 'delighted' to be patron of
OL,4,AThe Christie
OL,5,
OL,6,FCatherine, Princess of Wales has become
OL,7,Fthe patron of The Christie hospital in
OL,8,FManchester, describing it as an
OL,9,F"extraordinary place".
OL,11,FThe princess, a former cancer patient,
OL,12,Fsaid she was "delighted" to become the
OL,13,Ffigurehead of the leading cancer
OL,14,Ftreatment hospital and The Christie
OL,15,FCharity after visiting its Withington
OL,16,Fsite in June.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
