OL,3,ACatherine 'delighted' to be patron of
OL,4,AThe Christie
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer cancer journey is the subject of a
OL,7,Fnew documentary called Heal, which
OL,8,Ffeatures the her saying how being
OL,9,F"faced with your own mortality" meant
OL,10,Faccepting life is not infinite which
OL,11,F"softens your heart".
OL,13,FIn a social media post, the she wrote:
OL,14,F"During my visit to The Christie NHS
OL,15,FFoundation Trust, I saw first-hand how
OL,16,Fexceptional care extends beyond
OL,17,Ftreatment alone.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
